{"timestamp":"2026-02-03T13:26:36.262Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","call_id":"call_tc8eerQop0iVNrZ8stUgJDtg","output":"[{\"text\":\"### Ran Playwright code\\n```js\\nawait page.getByRole('button', { name: 'Attach' }).click();\\n```\\n### Page\\n- Page URL: http://localhost:3000/\\n- Page Title: docker-git console\\n### Snapshot\\n```yaml\\n- <changed> generic [ref=e1]:\\n  - generic [ref=e2]:\\n    - ref=e3 [unchanged]\\n    - generic [ref=e9]:\\n      - generic [ref=e10]:\\n        - ref=e11 [unchanged]\\n        - generic [ref=e16]:\\n          - ref=e17 [unchanged]\\n          - button \\\"Detach\\\" [ref=e18] [cursor=pointer]\\n          - ref=e19 [unchanged]\\n      - generic [ref=e20]:\\n        - ref=e21 [unchanged]\\n        - main [ref=e27]:\\n          - generic [ref=e28]:\\n            - ref=e29 [unchanged]\\n            - generic [ref=e30]: connected\\n          - generic [ref=e31]:\\n            - generic [ref=e81]:\\n              - textbox \\\"Terminal input\\\" [active] [ref=e82]\\n              - generic [ref=e83]:\\n                - generic [ref=e85]: minimized by removi\\n                - generic [ref=e87]: ng packages and cont\\n                - generic [ref=e89]: ent that are\\n                - generic [ref=e91]: not required on a sy\\n                - generic [ref=e93]: stem that users do n\\n                - generic [ref=e95]: ot log into.\\n                - generic [ref=e98]: To restore this cont\\n                - generic [ref=e100]: ent, you can run the\\n                - generic [ref=e102]: \\\"'unminimize' comman\\\"\\n                - generic [ref=e104]: d.\\n                - generic [ref=e106]: \\\"Last login: Tue Feb\\\"\\n                - generic [ref=e108]: 3 13:24:36 2026 fro\\n                - generic [ref=e110]: m 192.168.32.1\\n                - generic [ref=e111]:\\n                  - generic [ref=e112]: ubuntu@9ea3c62b73f6\\n                  - generic [ref=e113]: \\\":\\\"\\n 