                                                                            │\n│ Codex auth: ./.orch/auth/codex -> /home/dev/.codex                                                                                                     │\n│ Project directory: /home/user/docker-git/effect-template/.docker-git/octocat/hello-world                                                               │\n│ Container: dg-hello-world                                                                                                                              │\n│ Service: dg-hello-world                                                                                                                                │\n│ SSH command: ssh -i /home/user/docker-git/dev_ssh_key -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no -o UserKnownHostsFile=/dev/null -p 2222 dev@localhost                │\n│ Repo: https://github.com/octocat/hello-world (main)                                                                                                    │\n│ Workspace: /home/dev/app                                                                                                                               │\n│ Authorized keys: /home/user/docker-git/effect-template/.docker-git/authorized_keys                                                                     │\n│ Env global: /home/user/docker-git/effect-template/.docker-git/octocat/hello-world/.orch/env/global.env                                                 │\n│ Env project: /home/user/docker-git/effect-template/.docker-git/octocat/hello-world/.orch/env/project.env                                               │\n│ Codex auth: /home/user/docker-git/effect-template/.docker-git/octocat/hello-world/.orch/auth/codex -> /home/dev/.codex                                 │\n│ Project directory: /home/user/docker-git/effect-template/.docker-git/effect-template                                                                   │\n│ Container: dg-effect-template                  