m that users do not log into.\n\nTo restore this content, you can run the 'unminimize' command.\nLast login: Tue Feb  3 07:46:56 2026 from 192.168.32.1\nubuntu@9ea3c62b73f6:~$ ls\npublicrust\nubuntu@9ea3c62b73f6:~$ cd\nubuntu@9ea3c62b73f6:~$ codex\nError loading config.toml: Failed to read config file /home/dev/.codex/config.toml: Permission denied (os error 13)\nubuntu@9ea3c62b73f6:~$ \n```\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"# Context from my IDE setup:\n\n## Open tabs:\n- route.ts: effect-template/packages/web/src/app/api/projects/[projectId]/exec/route.ts\n- config.yml: /home/user/.codex/evocomp/config.yml\n- config.toml: /home/user/.codex/leadforgeai/config.toml\n- default.rules: /home/user/.codex/rules/default.rules\n\n## My request for Codex:\nДостаточно криво отображается\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"<image>"},{"type":"input_image","image_url":"data:image/png;base64,"},{"type":"input_text","text":"</image>"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"# Context from my IDE setup:\n\n## Open tabs:\n- route.ts: effect-template/packages/web/src/app/api/projects/[projectId]/exec/route.ts\n- config.yml: /home/user/.codex/evocomp/config.yml\n- config.toml: /home/user/.codex/leadforgeai/config.toml\n- default.rules: /home/user/.codex/rules/default.rules\n\n## My request for Codex:\nВсё равно отображение терминала очень кривое\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"<image>"},{"type":"input_image","image_url":"data:image/png;base64,"},{"type":"input_text","text":"</image>"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"# Context from my IDE setup:\n\n## Open tabs:\n- route.ts: effect-template/packages/web/src/app/api/projects/[projectId]/exec/route.ts\n- config.yml: /home/user/.codex/evocomp/config.yml\n- config.toml: /home/user/.codex/leadforgeai/config.toml\n- default.rules: /home/user/.codex/rules/default.rules\n\n## My request for Codex:\nЯ что-то пишу а он этого даж