tton secondary small\" disabled=\"\">Kill</button></div><div class=\"list terminal-list\"><div class=\"empty-state\">No terminals yet. Click Attach or New.</div></div></aside><div class=\"terminal-view\"><div class=\"terminal-grid single\"><div class=\"terminal-shell placeholder-shell\"><div class=\"terminal-placeholder\">Attach to open a full Linux TTY (Vim, tmux, TUIs supported).</div></div></div></div></div></main>\n\n```\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"<image>"},{"type":"input_image","image_url":"data:image/png;base64,"},{"type":"input_text","text":"</image>"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"# Context from my IDE setup:\n\n## Active file: effect-template/packages/web/next.config.mjs\n\n## Open tabs:\n- next.config.mjs: effect-template/packages/web/next.config.mjs\n- page.tsx: effect-template/packages/web/src/app/page.tsx\n- route.ts: effect-template/packages/web/src/app/api/projects/[projectId]/exec/route.ts\n- route.ts: effect-template/packages/web/src/app/api/projects/[projectId]/up/route.ts\n- config.yml: /home/user/.codex/evocomp/config.yml\n\n## My request for Codex:\nЭтот блок пока убери куда-то\nЯ не знаю для чего он\nЛибо сделай что бы он скрывался\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"<image>"},{"type":"input_image","image_url":"data:image/png;base64,"},{"type":"input_text","text":"</image>"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"# Context from my IDE setup:\n\n## Active file: effect-template/packages/web/next.config.mjs\n\n## Open tabs:\n- next.config.mjs: effect-template/packages/web/next.config.mjs\n- page.tsx: effect-template/packages/web/src/app/page.tsx\n- route.ts: effect-template/packages/web/src/app/api/projects/[projectId]/exec/route.ts\n- route.ts: effect-template/packages/web/src/app/api/projects/[projectId]/up/route.ts\n- config.yml: /home/user/.codex/evocomp/config.yml\n\n## My request for Codex:\nА почему терминал не работает?\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"<image>"},{"type":"input_image","image_url":"data:image/png;base64,"},{"type":"input_text","text":"</image>"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"# Context from my IDE setup:\n\n## Active file: effect-template/packages/web/next.config.mjs\n\n## Open tabs:\n- next.config.mjs: effect-template/packages/web/next.config.mjs\n- page.tsx: effect-template/packages/web/src/app/page.tsx\n- route.ts: effect-template/packages/web/src/app/api/projects/[projectId]/exec/route.ts\n- route.ts: effect-template/packages/web/src/app/api/projects/[projectId]/up/route.ts\n- config.yml: /home/user/.codex/evocomp/config.yml\n\n## My request for Codex:\nСделай по виду выбор проектов и тд и тп как условную CRM\n\nНу типо файловую систему мб\n\nТ.е есть проекты(docker-git контейнеры) слево/cверху (вкладки)\n\nИ в них есть рабочее простарснвто с терминалами\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"<image>"},{"type":"input_image","image_url":"data:image/png;base64,"},{"type":"input_text","text":"</image>"}]},{"type":"compaction","encrypted_content":"gAAAAABpgfqXTOXJQLVxSF7vN4Gsd-haIdqXlRD50ztFPCIgx2S1fwXDPeBKevH4bO81WkKkpVY0DV8SocM5bjVIiDEB8JpsmrEjckEcOYiTBtqfKEfEgAsAuoWLJqrRgAnfdX_iG1GKvMBkB_XJIgPgvsi_jFhKjEWzhSem0DJaoURxKuiiOAbxZQlUTrY4SyFa86dmOYgCq6wuY4Eu1i7JhoFDOdtePREKHj14S0bYxzYgsoJFjWjcRtBIaW0jH0a6a4PbZA7hd7uXti3v20adEkfOqCqmi4jEpdpdQNUc5rbItQbAfuQUgK8X6V-JjtEYiFjElv3_rmYNCBI1ZAaAH5PsM_X-CSCg4f68iUY7MdkIac3x4ZIF0PF266FYk9TwKq5bhNpPSq0xQupQ2Ooshge8PLuMTksNyUUxZJ2iZQN-1BR3hf6kvoHKLkC8jmrl1gxT7ws0RpzLYkDKqg96swzstWuBbokdnx0F0PR4qIM6JBn3t9OcFQEm3DiJUVEHBz53qd9fz-7-9s5mdo2J6zEODhXh-RfCKWjiwKDtgMlWd4htxg4RSMqWIyAiBsakQA1MQdskxxz7ClAD9WYBvom_93gJTaOrKPenghvQKFyf6MKl1XGFUPg0ShBEpwtI2NzJeV1UTwls1dNNg1C-l0jQoGP0SPEUKh4FZIv7Iyz6xzdMVchdSze2_CL7-d8rb1yWgUBr2d1qtWaUja4TYwaZRDB86b87Jhm0d9dezDEkHJVY66t3zy9n21R_JfzZz54K5RLeAoOOjOBQ6snuHdJvqnNTxgaCiez2iUIQDR9-rkzK2N4dJb1OuVB8f52JjMKH3HQshX5Bn49Mbi8P2yMZoJJH-47I_AJhXf168Og2h__4z_zjCqrPGw6MZLmKSzQC-NPGyhc7iuoMTU8SqOtRMUu-w1nmjs2eKwd