{"timestamp":"2026-02-03T18:24:44.923Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_reasoning","text":"**Diagnosing frontend terminal connection issues**\n\nThe session logic creates a connecting status and uses a fallback WebSocket port, so the backend API is likely reachable. The terminal doesn't show because the terminal container may not be properly initialized or rendered, possibly due to the ref missing after layout changes or React StrictMode causing unmounts. Next, I'll add diagnostic logs to verify if the terminal container ref and createTerminal are being called as expected."}}
