{"timestamp":"2026-02-03T18:30:41.615Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","call_id":"call_988jpGH8gdwhNQ6OklJMLaTu","output":"[{\"text\":\"### Ran Playwright code\\n```js\\nawait page.goto('http://localhost:3000');\\n```\\n### Page\\n- Page URL: http://localhost:3000/\\n- Page Title: docker-git console\\n### Snapshot\\n```yaml\\n- generic [active] [ref=e1]:\\n  - generic [ref=e2]:\\n    - banner [ref=e3]:\\n      - generic [ref=e4]:\\n        - generic [ref=e5]: docker-git\\n        - generic [ref=e6]: Visual control room for container workspaces\\n      - generic [ref=e7]: Connected · none\\n    - main [ref=e10]:\\n      - generic [ref=e12]:\\n        - generic [ref=e13]:\\n          - generic [ref=e14]:\\n            - generic [ref=e15]: \\\"SSH: -\\\"\\n            - generic [ref=e16]: \\\"Repo: -\\\"\\n            - generic [ref=e17]: \\\"Ref: -\\\"\\n            - generic [ref=e18]: \\\"Status: unknown\\\"\\n          - generic [ref=e19]:\\n            - button \\\"Attach\\\" [ref=e20] [cursor=pointer]\\n            - button \\\"Detach\\\" [disabled] [ref=e21] [cursor=pointer]\\n            - button \\\"Show details\\\" [ref=e22] [cursor=pointer]\\n        - main [ref=e24]:\\n          - generic [ref=e25]:\\n            - generic [ref=e26]: Live terminal\\n            - generic [ref=e27]: detached\\n          - generic [ref=e28]:\\n            - generic [ref=e32]: Attach to open a full Linux TTY (Vim, tmux, TUIs supported).\\n            - complementary [ref=e33]:\\n              - generic [ref=e34]:\\n                - generic [ref=e35]: Terminals\\n                - generic [ref=e36]: \\\"0\\\"\\n              - generic [ref=e37]:\\n                - button \\\"New\\\" [disabled] [ref=e38] [cursor=pointer]\\n                - button \\\"Split\\\" [disabled] [ref=e39] [cursor=pointer]\\n                - button \\\"Focus\\\" [disabled] [ref=e40] [cursor=pointer]\\n                - button \\\"Kill\\\" [disabled] [ref=e41] [cursor=